{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2023-05-19 07:00:00', 'title': 'ROBOSENSE JOINS NVIDIA OMNIVERSE ECOSYSTEM', 'text': "SHENZHEN, CHINA--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #LIDAR--ROBOSENSE, A WORLD-LEADING PROVIDER OF SMART LIDAR SENSOR SYSTEMS, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS NOW CONNECTED TO THE NVIDIA OMNIVERSE ECOSYSTEM, USING THE DEVELOPMENT PLATFORM BASED ON UNIVERSAL SCENE DESCRIPTION (USD) TO ACCELERATE THE DEVELOPMENT, TESTING, AND VALIDATION OF ITS SENSOR TECHNOLOGY. ROBOSENSE'S SECOND-GENERATION SMART SOLID-STATE LIDAR MODEL IS INTEGRATED INTO NVIDIA DRIVE SIM, BUILT ON OMNIVERSE, ENABLING PHYSICALLY BASED, HIGH-FIDELITY SENSOR SIMULAT."}